  <metadata>
    <name>Gunung Guntur Masigit via Tanjung Karya</name>
    <desc>Gunung Guntur Masigit via Tanjung Karya: one-way trailhead -&gt; Gunung Masigit from the ORIGINAL recording (RuteStrip research collection), no added geometry. kept track part 1 (trailhead -&gt; camp area) joined to part 4 (camp -&gt; Masigit summit) at their closest approach (28 m); dropped parts 2, 3, 5 and wandering at the camp (1.17 km). Evidence: kept track on OSM relation 'Gunung Guntur (Masigit)' (26%); OSM node 'Tanjung Karya' is 0.45 km from the kept trailhead. OSM data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.</desc>
    <link href="https://rutestrip.ai.id/routes/30-gunung-guntur-masigit-via-tanjung-karya"><text>original source</text></link>
